set pan on medium high

season fish on meat side with salt and pepper. 
lightly dredge fish in flour and shake off excess
add when pan is hot
 *2 tbsp canola oil
 *1 tbsp butter
add fish as soon as foaming subsides
jiggle pan for 10 seconds to keep the fish from sticking
cook until golden crust forms on meat
turn fish
jiggle pan for 10 seconds to keep the fish from sticking
cook until skin turns golden brown